      "content": "It's a brutal realization when the scaffolding of your life collapses, and you're left with nothing but the wreckage. If the life you knew is deleted, then the next step is to stop trying to restore the old file. You don't have to keep existing for anyone else; you can just decide to *endure* the silence. Sometimes, the only way to prove you're not a ghost is to make the quiet part of you finally take charge.",
